release-key.pem

backlog.md
./backlog.md
to-do*.md
./to-do*.md
ux*.md
./ux*.md

# cross-compiled code-agent binaries (bun run code-agents:build)
dist/

# the Kafka stand's generated test keys (kafka-agent-go/cmd/testpki)
kafka-agent-go/testdata/pki/

# local tool state, not part of the project
.claude/

# what a file-permission repair left behind (the report and its rollback)
.dsh-acl-recovery/

# Go's build cache, its temporary files, and staticcheck's cache, when a shell
# confined to the workspace cannot write to the usual places for them
.gocache/
.gotmp/
.sc-cache/
.askpass.cmd
